    "description": "The Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health, Aga Khan University (AKU), East Africa has signed a partnership agreement with Philips Foundation to enable access of portable ultrasound equipments and Mobile Obstetric Monitoring (MOM) application in Kilifi County.",
